  "english_paragraphs": [
    "We are a family of three, and everyone has their own favorite food. I like to eat vegetables, especially spicy food, but I don't like rice. My husband not only likes to eat vegetables, but also likes to eat meat. But he can't eat spicy food and only likes to eat light food. Our child likes sweet things the most, including bread, cakes, and fruits. But we are also worried because he always doesn't like eating meat and vegetables and can only eat a little at a time. How can we get our children to eat more healthy food?"
  ],
  "english_full": "We are a family of three, and everyone has their own favorite food. I like to eat vegetables, especially spicy food, but I don't like rice. My husband not only likes to eat vegetables, but also likes to eat meat. But he can't eat spicy food and only likes to eat light food. Our child likes sweet things the most, including bread, cakes, and fruits. But we are also worried because he always doesn't like eating meat and vegetables and can only eat a little at a time. How can we get our children to eat more healthy food?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Мы семья из троих человек, и у каждого есть своя любимая еда. Я люблю кушать овощи, особенно острые блюда, но рис я не люблю."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Mý smóý s'ém'ya iz tróikh chelóvek, i u kázhdogo yest' svóya lýubimaya éda. Ya lúblyu kúshat' óvoshchi, osobónno óstryye blýda, no ris ya ne lúblyu."
  ],
